  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen. \n\nSound familiar? You've been here a while - you had a long life, and a pretty good one at that. So your movie is taking a bit of time, and of course you had to watch all of the other yous' movies as well. \n\nThe movies you see are not particularly interesting or exciting ones. But they were decent lives. And there were lessons to be learned from them. Which is the whole point after all. \n\nWhen the movie ends, you are once again in blackness. When the lights come up you see most of the ones in the audience focused on you.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 21,
